# README media: RIMSHIRE. In the GIF and the battle shot the demo player
# (Brass) and the computer (Plum) press real buttons; the armies, the board
# and the screens are set up with cheats.
shotscale 2
seed 41
game rimshire
wait 90
shot rimshire_title
# war 7, a few turns in: the routes drawn across the board
cheat clear 1 1
cheat clear 2 1
cheat clear 3 1
cheat clear 4 1
cheat clear 5 1
cheat clear 6 1
cheat war 7
botuntil turns >= 6 20000
botuntil wstate == 0 3000
wait 20
shot rimshire_board
# two full armies by a lake
cheat army 0 WSLHRYFP
cheat army 1 BEAMOTWS
cheat battle 7 3 0
waituntil bphase == 1 200
botplay 240
gifstart rimshire 4 2
botplay 600
gifstop
botplay 720
shot rimshire_battle
# the last war's card: Lady Brass writes
cheat clear 7 1
cheat clear 8 1
cheat clear 9 1
cheat title
wait 20
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 30
press UP
wait 5
press A
wait 60
shot rimshire_card
